  "translation": "And Asa called to YHWH his Elohim, and he said: “YHWH, there is none with you to help, between the great and to one with no strength. Help us, YHWH our Elohim, for on you we have leaned, and in your name we have come against this multitude. You are YHWH our Elohim — let not mortal prevail with you.”",
